    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squash and Spell is a fun &amp; friendly game designed for children as soon as they show an interest to interact with a computer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun on screen representation of all the letters in the alphabet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/Letters.gif?t=1754586966\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spelling rainbow with lots of words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A word processor mode which lets children type and see the result.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/39974150278e6fd6d2913d9d28f2219f.poster.avif?t=1754586966\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/39974150278e6fd6d2913d9d28f2219f.webm?t=1754586966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/39974150278e6fd6d2913d9d28f2219f.mp4?t=1754586966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted, including a toggle for phonics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A writing mode where, depending on hardware, children can use a stylus, touch or mouse to draw letters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/ba9ed368a3e47627402d395a5704926c.poster.avif?t=1754586966\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/ba9ed368a3e47627402d395a5704926c.webm?t=1754586966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/ba9ed368a3e47627402d395a5704926c.mp4?t=1754586966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time of day system with cosy ambient sounds.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squash and Spell is a fun &amp; friendly game designed for children as soon as they show an interest to interact with a computer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun on screen representation of all the letters in the alphabet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/Letters.gif?t=1754586966\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spelling rainbow with lots of words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A word processor mode which lets children type and see the result.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/39974150278e6fd6d2913d9d28f2219f.poster.avif?t=1754586966\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/39974150278e6fd6d2913d9d28f2219f.webm?t=1754586966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/39974150278e6fd6d2913d9d28f2219f.mp4?t=1754586966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted, including a toggle for phonics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A writing mode where, depending on hardware, children can use a stylus, touch or mouse to draw letters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/ba9ed368a3e47627402d395a5704926c.poster.avif?t=1754586966\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/ba9ed368a3e47627402d395a5704926c.webm?t=1754586966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/ba9ed368a3e47627402d395a5704926c.mp4?t=1754586966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time of day system with cosy ambient sounds.</p></li></ul>",
